#: symfile.c:3865
msgid ""
"Load symbol table from executable file FILE.\n"
"Usage: symbol-file [-readnow | -readnever] [-o OFF] FILE\n"
"OFF is an optional offset which is added to each section address.\n"
"The `file' command can also load symbol tables, as well as setting the file\n"
"to execute.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ladda symboltabell från körbar fil FIL.\n"
"Användning: symbol-fil [-readnow | -readnever] [-o OFF]\n"
"FIL OFF är en valfri förskjutning som läggs till varje sektionsadress.\n"
"Kommandot `file' kan också ladda symboltabeller, samt ställa in filen som "
"ska\n"
"köras.\n"

#: symfile.c:3873
msgid ""
"Load symbols from FILE, assuming FILE has been dynamically loaded.\n"
"Usage: add-symbol-file FILE [-readnow|-readnever] [-o OFF] [ADDR]\n"
"                       [-s SECT-NAME SECT-ADDR]...\n"
"ADDR is the starting address of the file's text.\n"
"Each '-s' argument provides a section name and address, and\n"
"should be specified if the data and bss segments are not contiguous\n"
"with the text.  SECT-NAME is a section name to be loaded at SECT-ADDR.\n"
"OFF is an optional offset which is added to the default load addresses\n"
"of all sections for which no other address was specified.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ladda symboler från FIL, förutsatt att FIL har laddats dynamiskt.\n"
"Användning: add-symbol-file FIL [-readnow|-readnever] [-o OFF]\n"
"[ADDR] [-s SECT-NAME SECT-ADDR]... ADDR är\n"
"startadressen för filens text. Varje '-s'-argument\n"
"anger ett sektionsnamn och en adress och bör anges om\n"
"data- och bss-segmenten inte är sammanhängande med texten. SECT-NAME\n"
"är ett sektionsnamn som ska laddas vid SECT-ADDR. OFF är en valfri\n"
"offset som läggs till standardladdningsadresserna för alla sektioner\n"
"för vilka ingen annan adress har angetts.\n"

#: symfile.c:3890
msgid ""
"Remove a symbol file added via the add-symbol-file command.\n"
"Usage: remove-symbol-file FILENAME\n"
"       remove-symbol-file -a ADDRESS\n"
"The file to remove can be identified by its filename or by an address\n"
"that lies within the boundaries of this symbol file in memory.\n"
"Options:\n"
"%OPTIONS%"
msgstr "Ta bort en symbolfil som lagts till med kommandot add-symbol-file.\nAnvändning: remove-symbol-file FILENAME\n       remove-symbol-file -a ADDRESS\nFilen som ska tas bort kan identifieras med filnamnet eller en adress\nsom ligger inom symbolfilens gränser i minnet.\nAlternativ:\n%OPTIONS%"

#: symfile.c:3904
msgid ""
"Dynamically load FILE into the running program.\n"
"FILE symbols are recorded for access from GDB.\n"
"Usage: load [FILE] [OFFSET]\n"
"An optional load OFFSET may also be given as a literal address.\n"
"When OFFSET is provided, FILE must also be provided.  FILE can be provided\n"
"on its own."
msgstr ""
"Ladda FILE dynamiskt i det körande programmet.\n"
"FILE-symboler registreras för åtkomst från\n"
"GDB. Användning: load [FILE]\n"
"[OFFSET] En valfri load OFFSET kan också anges som en bokstavlig\n"
"adress. När OFFSET anges måste även FILE anges. FILE kan anges separat\n"
"."

