#: symmisc.c:1056
msgid ""
"Print dump of current symbol definitions.\n"
"Usage: mt print symbols [-pc ADDRESS] [--] [OUTFILE]\n"
"       mt print symbols [-objfile OBJFILE] [-source SOURCE] [--] [OUTFILE]\n"
"Entries in the full symbol table are dumped to file OUTFILE,\n"
"or the terminal if OUTFILE is unspecified.\n"
"If ADDRESS is provided, dump only the symbols for the file\n"
"with code at that address.\n"
"If SOURCE is provided, dump only that file's symbols.\n"
"If OBJFILE is provided, dump only that object file's symbols."
msgstr ""
"Skriv ut dumpning av aktuella symboldefinitioner.\n"
"Användning: mt print symbols [-pc ADDRESS] [--] [OUTFILE]\n"
"mt print symbols [-objfile OBJFILE] [-source SOURCE] [--] [OUTFILE] Poster "
"i\n"
"den fullständiga symboltabellen dumpas till filen OUTFILE, eller\n"
"till terminalen om OUTFILE inte anges. Om\n"
"ADDRESS anges, dumpas endast symbolerna för filen med kod på\n"
"den adressen. Om SOURCE anges,\n"
"dumpas endast symbolerna för den filen. Om OBJFILE anges,\n"
"dumpas endast symbolerna för den objektfilen."

#: symmisc.c:1068
msgid ""
"Print dump of current minimal symbol definitions.\n"
"Usage: mt print msymbols [-objfile OBJFILE] [--] [OUTFILE]\n"
"Entries in the minimal symbol table are dumped to file OUTFILE,\n"
"or the terminal if OUTFILE is unspecified.\n"
"If OBJFILE is provided, dump only that file's minimal symbols."
msgstr ""
"Skriv ut dumpning av aktuella minimala symboldefinitioner.\n"
"Användning: mt print msymbols [-objfile OBJFILE] [--] [OUTFILE]\n"
"Poster i den minimala symboltabellen dumpas till filen OUTFILE, eller\n"
"till terminalen om OUTFILE inte anges. Om\n"
"OBJFILE anges, dumpas endast den filens minimala symboler."

#: symmisc.c:1077
msgid ""
"Print dump of current object file definitions.\n"
"With an argument REGEXP, list the object files with matching names."
msgstr ""
"Skriv ut dump av aktuella objektfildefinitioner.\n"
"Med argumentet REGEXP listas objektfiler med matchande namn."

#: symmisc.c:1081
msgid ""
"List the full symbol tables for all object files.\n"
"This does not include information about individual symbols, blocks, or\n"
"linetables --- just the symbol table structures themselves.\n"
"With an argument REGEXP, list the symbol tables with matching names."
msgstr ""
"Lista alla symboltabeller för alla objektfiler.\n"
"Detta inkluderar inte information om enskilda symboler, block eller\n"
"linjetabeller – bara själva symboltabellstrukturerna. Med\n"
"argumentet REGEXP listas symboltabellerna med matchande namn."

#: symmisc.c:1088
msgid ""
"List the contents of all line tables, from all symbol tables.\n"
"With an argument REGEXP, list just the line tables for the symbol\n"
"tables with matching names."
msgstr ""
"Lista innehållet i alla linjetabeller, från alla symboltabeller.\n"
"Med argumentet REGEXP listas endast linjetabellerna för symboltabellerna\n"
"med matchande namn."

#: symmisc.c:1095
msgid "Check consistency of currently expanded symtabs."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollera konsistensen hos de symtabs som för närvarande är expanderade."

#: symmisc.c:1100
