#: tui/tui-layout.c:1317
msgid ""
"Create a new TUI layout.\n"
"Usage: tui new-layout [-horizontal] NAME WINDOW WEIGHT [WINDOW WEIGHT]...\n"
"Create a new TUI layout.  The new layout will be named NAME,\n"
"and can be accessed using \"layout NAME\".\n"
"The windows will be displayed in the specified order.\n"
"A WINDOW can also be of the form:\n"
"  { [-horizontal] NAME WEIGHT [NAME WEIGHT]... }\n"
"This form indicates a sub-frame.\n"
"Each WEIGHT is an integer, which holds the relative size\n"
"to be allocated to the window."
msgstr ""
"Skapa en ny TUI-layout.\n"
"Användning: tui new-layout [-horizontal] NAME WINDOW WEIGHT [WINDOW\n"
"WEIGHT]... Skapa en ny TUI-layout. Den nya layouten kommer\n"
"att få namnet NAME och kan nås med \"layout\n"
"NAME\". Fönstren kommer att visas i den angivna ordningen.\n"
"Ett FÖNSTER kan också ha formen:\n"
"{ [-horizontal] NAMN VIKT [NAMN VIKT]... } Denna\n"
"form indikerar en underram. Varje\n"
"VIKT är ett heltal som anger den relativa storlek som ska\n"
"tilldelas fönstret."

